<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-ATLETICO MADRID WANT ROSTOCK'S AKPOBORIE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ATLETICO MADRID WANT ROSTOCK'S AKPOBORIE.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atletico Madrid are interested in signing Jonathan Akpoborie from Bundeliga side Hansa Rostock and have already watched the Nigerian striker in action, Germany's Kicker magazine reported on Thursday.</p>
<p>Kicker said Atletico were prepared to pay up to eight million marks ($5 million) for Akpoborie who has scored 10 of Rostock's 19 league goals this season.</p>
